{# ============================================================================
   HADIYA · كروت المناسبات  (gift-tiles) — engine E4 · القصة والمناسبة
   ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
   One grid, two looks — picked by `style`:

     arch   ╭──╮ ╭──╮ ╭──╮      "بمناسبة إيه؟" — an arch per occasion,
            │  │ │  │ │  │       label centred under it. On a phone the
            ╰──╯ ╰──╯ ╰──╯       row becomes a swipe strip.
            عيد  زفاف  مواليد

     card   ┌──────┐┌──────┐     "لمين الهدية؟" — tall cards, the name
            │      ││      │      and a hint line sitting at the foot.
            │ ليها ││ ليه  │
            └──────┘└──────┘

   Each tile is a block with a plain link, not a collections picker: a picker
   inside a block is reported to stop the editor drawing that block's
   settings. Typing `/shop/<handle>` also lets a tile point at a filtered URL
   (`/shop/gifts?filters[price][max]=500`), which a picker could not.

   A tile without a picture shows its `tint` (or a palette default), so a
   fresh install reads as designed rather than as broken images.

   Styling: assets/theme.css → "gift-tiles".
   ========================================================================= #}

{% set id = widget.id %}
{% set d = widget.data %}
{% set tiles = widget.blocks | default([], true) %}

{% macro mediaUrl(m) %}{% if m %}{% if m is string %}{{ m }}{% elif m.fileUrl %}{{ m.fileUrl }}{% elif m.url %}{{ m.url }}{% endif %}{% endif %}{% endmacro %}

